  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Albanian Youth and Enhancing Integration Into Serbian Society - Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address the challenges faced by the Albanian minority in Serbia, particularly in Presevo and Bujanovac. It focuses on boosting their socio-political integration and representation, while also providing professional development opportunities. Key initiatives include establishing a youth caucus connected to the Serbian Assembly and Serbian national institutions/ministries, facilitating mentorship and networking in various professional fields, offering internships in local institutions, and supporting civil society projects. Additionally, the project promotes intercultural understanding through study visits between Albanian and Serbian youth. The goal of the project is to foster conflict prevention by creation of a more inclusive, harmonious society without ethnic and cultural divides.</narrative>
  </description>
